// QR Code Generator for Eagle/Fusion Electronics
// This ULP generates QR codes directly on PCB layers
// Version 1.2.0 - fully self-contained (native QR generation, embedded
//                 localization, no remote calls, no external file imports).
//
// Starting with this release, the ULP is a single self-contained file:
//   - QR Code generation runs entirely in pure ULP (no Python server).
//   - All UI text translations are embedded in this file (no localization.csv).
//   - The legacy version-check feature has been removed; the previous
//     versions.csv mechanism is preserved server-side only for users still
//     running ULP releases earlier than 1.2.0.

